# Requisicoes na ordem da demonstracao.
# Funciona no Visual Studio e no VS Code com a extensao REST Client.
# Depois do passo 2, copie o accessToken da resposta para a variavel @token.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = COLE_AQUI_O_accessToken_DO_PASSO_2
@investmentId = COLE_AQUI_O_id_DO_PASSO_5
@assetClassId = 6

### 1) Cadastrar o investidor -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Marcio Rodrigues",
  "email": "marcio@exemplo.com",
  "password": "Senha@12345"
}

### 2) Autenticar -> 200 com o accessToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marcio@exemplo.com",
  "password": "Senha@12345"
}

### 3) Listar aportes SEM o token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/investments

### 4) Conferir de quem e o token -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Registrar um aporte -> 201 (guarde o id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/investments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetClass": "Ações",
  "amount": 1500.75,
  "investedOn": "2026-09-01",
  "institution": "XP",
  "notes": "PETR4"
}

### 6) Registrar outro aporte, em outra classe -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/investments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetClass": "tesouro direto",
  "amount": 500,
  "investedOn": "2026-08-10",
  "institution": "Tesouro Direto"
}

### 7) Listar os aportes do investidor autenticado -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/investments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8) Resumo da carteira: total e participacao por classe -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/investments/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9) Obter um aporte pelo id -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/investments/{{investmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10) Alterar o aporte -> 200 (repare no changedAt)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/investments/{{investmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetClass": "Renda Fixa",
  "amount": 3000,
  "investedOn": "2026-07-15",
  "institution": "Nubank",
  "notes": "CDB 110% do CDI"
}

### 11) Remover o aporte -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/investments/{{investmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12) Remover de novo o mesmo aporte -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/investments/{{investmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13) Aporte sem a data -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/investments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetClass": "Ações",
  "amount": 100
}

### 14) Aporte com data futura -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/investments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetClass": "Ações",
  "amount": 100,
  "investedOn": "2030-01-01"
}

### 15) Aporte em uma classe que nao existe -> 400 listando as disponiveis
POST {{baseUrl}}/investments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetClass": "Previdência",
  "amount": 100,
  "investedOn": "2026-05-05"
}

### 16) Listar as classes de ativo (note o investmentCount) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/asset-classes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17) Cadastrar uma classe de ativo -> 201 (guarde o id em @assetClassId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/asset-classes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Previdência Privada"
}

### 18) Cadastrar a mesma classe sem acento -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/asset-classes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "previdencia privada"
}

### 19) Usar a classe nova em um aporte -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/investments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetClass": "PREVIDENCIA PRIVADA",
  "amount": 800,
  "investedOn": "2026-06-01"
}

### 20) Remover a classe que agora esta em uso -> 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/asset-classes/{{assetClassId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21) Renomear a classe -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/asset-classes/{{assetClassId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Previdência"
}

### 22) Cadastrar o mesmo e-mail duas vezes -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Outro Alguem",
  "email": "marcio@exemplo.com",
  "password": "Senha@54321"
}

### 23) Autenticar com a senha errada -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marcio@exemplo.com",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}

### 24) Limite de tentativas: repita esta chamada mais de dez vezes seguidas -> 429 com Retry-After
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marcio@exemplo.com",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}

### 25) Sonda de saude (sem token) -> 200 com o estado da aplicacao e do banco
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
